meta {
  name: Unread Status
  type: http
  seq: 9
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/notes/unread?entityType=TRUCK&entityIds={{truckId}}
  body: none
  auth: bearer
}

params:query {
  entityType: TRUCK
  entityIds: {{truckId}}
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{accessToken}}
}

docs {
  Unread badges for list screens (`NoteResource.getUnreadStatus`). `entityIds` is comma-separated, at
  most 100 (duplicates are ignored). Doesn't mark anything read; only "List Notes" does.

  Response `data`: `[{ entityId, unread }]` in the order asked. `unread` is true when someone else added
  a live note since the caller last listed that entity's notes. Entities the caller can't see come back
  `unread: false`.

  Roles: every torg role except DRIVER. VAHN_ADMIN can't call this (its views aren't tracked).
  400 for a missing or unknown `entityType`, missing or non-numeric `entityIds`, or more than 100.
}
